#. module: l10n_cz_fs
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_cz_fs.field_cssk_fs_statement_version__l10n_cz_fs_scope
msgid ""
"Czech statements only (vyhláška č. 500/2002 Sb., § 3a). The full scope "
"carries every item of přílohy 1 and 2; the abridged one only the items "
"marked with letters and Roman numerals (plus C.II.1 and C.II.2 of the "
"Rozvaha). The DPPDP9 return files its výkazy in the rozsah of the linked "
"statements."
msgstr ""

